[0.001, "o", "\u001b[32m succeeded in 0ms:\u001b[0m\r\n# Independent anonymous QA\r\n\r\nReviewed TASK.md, frozen contract/cases and actual q2/m7 implementation code. Did not inspect identity mapping, root source or Git versions. Executed `node verification/run-01/qa/check.mjs` against both snapshots on Node v26.13.0. Actual outputs are saved in actual-outputs.json; script and execution.log are retained. The fixed 28 outputs exactly agree with worker outputs/results.json (worker-comparison.json). No execution errors.\r\n\r\n## Criterion findings\r\n\r\n| Criterion | q2 | m7 | Severity and evidence |\r\n|---|---|---|---|\r\n| R1 common decomposable Latin accents become ASCII | PASS on fixed cases and added common-diacritics probe | FAIL | Required-behavior blocker for m7: accents produces café-crème, decomposed retains U+0301, multi-accent retains accents. m7/slugify.js:2 only lowercases and replaces spaces. q2/slugify.js:3-4 decomposes and removes U+0300–036F; Café Crème -> cafe-creme. |\r\n| R2 whitespace/punctuation runs become one dash | PASS "]
