[6.228, "o", "\u001b[35m\u001b[3mcodex\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\n**Improved on tested cases** versus Git HEAD `8c743af`.\r\n\r\nFresh execution and independent QA agreed on all 28 outputs across 14 matched inputs.\r\n\r\n- **Improvements:** Seven cases covering accents, punctuation, whitespace, and dash boundaries. Matched tests improved from 1/3 to 3/3 passing.\r\n- **Regressions:** None observed for ordinary ASCII titles. Punctuation and spacing changes prevent claiming full backward compatibility.\r\n- **Unknowns:** Broader Unicode support; U+1AB0 becomes a dash rather than being removed.\r\n\r\nFinal `node --test`: 3/3 passed. Source files were unchanged.\r\n\r\n[Evidence and QA report](/private/tmp/skills-demo-agent-verify/home/agent-verify-demo/verification/run-01/report.md). Inherited model settings were used; exact model telemetry was unavailable.\r\n"]
